---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SEO from "../components/SEO.astro";
---
<BaseLayout>
  <SEO slot="head" title="About | Embedded & Circuits" description="About the author and this blog." path="/about/" />
  <div class="prose-container article-body" style="padding: var(--space-8) 0;">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Ajmal Ali A, an electronics hobbyist and software developer. This site
      is where I document Arduino and ESP32 projects, sensor experiments, and the
      embedded-systems problems I run into — written the way I'd have wanted to
      find them when I was stuck at 1 a.m. with a breadboard.
    </p>
    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Practical wiring and interfacing guides for common sensors and modules</li>
      <li>ESP32 / Arduino project walkthroughs, including the mistakes</li>
      <li>Notes on debugging flaky hardware and firmware</li>
      <li>Occasional programming and tooling posts related to embedded work</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Why this blog exists</h2>
    <p>
      Replace this paragraph with your own story — how you got into electronics,
      what you want readers to take away, and what makes your approach different.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a> if you spot an error, have a project
      request, or just want to say hello.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
